  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">此資源包需要：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">*<a href=\"http://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">此資源包讓&nbsp;</span><strong><a href=\"http://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/als-zombies-revamped\" rel=\"nofollow\">AL's Zombies Revamped</a></strong><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;與 <a href=\"http://www.curseforge.com/members/fresh__lx/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh_LX</a> 的 Fresh Animations 相容！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8WVZPN3CB70?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>由於 AL's Zombies Revamped 為殭屍使用了自訂模型，因此單獨使用時無法與 Fresh Animations 相容。</p>\n<p>此擴充資源包透過提供搭配適當動畫的全新模型來解決此問題！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>重要事項：</strong></p>\n<p><strong>要使此資源包正常運作，必須將其載入順序排在 FA 之上。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>請依下列順序載入：</strong></p>\n<p>-本資源包</p>\n<p>-Fresh Animations</p>",
